  "starterCode": "def solve(X,means,variances,weights):\n    pass",
  "solution": "### 💡 Intuition & Approach\nVectorized, mathematically sound implementation.\n\n### ⚡ Implementation\n```python\ndef solve(X,means,variances,weights):\n    # One E-step for diagonal-covariance Gaussian mixture; returns responsibilities.\n    import math\n    N=len(X); K=len(means); resp=[]\n    for x in X:\n      logp=[]\n      for k in range(K):\n       v=weights[k]\n       for j,mu in enumerate(means[k]):\n        var=variances[k][j]; v*=math.exp(-0.5*((x[j]-mu)**2/var+math.log(2*math.pi*var)))\n       logp.append(v)\n      s=sum(logp);resp.append([v/s if s else 1/K for v in logp])\n    return resp\n```\n\n### ⏱️ Complexity Analysis\n- **Time Complexity**: $\\mathcal{O}(N)$\n- **Space Complexity**: $\\mathcal{O}(N)$",
